  "MCP servers you add to this project, for its agents: a command on this computer or an address on the internet. Each one is started and checked before any agent can use it; tools that read work from #1, tools that act from the mode you choose.": "MCP servers you add to this project, for its AIs: a command on this computer or an address on the internet. MADRE starts and checks each one before any AI can use it; tools that read work from «Just chat», tools that act from the permission you choose.",
